{
  "_about": "Crisis words for the deterministic safety check (spec 11.5). 'phrases' are plain text: English/Hinglish ones are matched as whole words, Devanagari ones as text. 'patterns' are regular expressions for flexible wording. Text is normalised first (lower case, straight quotes, k1ll->kill, dieee->die, s.u.i.c.i.d.e->suicide), so write entries in plain lower case. Every entry has an id, which is logged when it matches.",
